### RELEVANT LESSONS LEARNED:

Previous Lessons:
1. - Syntax errors in relational navigation using incorrect set comprehension block all verification; relational dot notation is the Alloy standard and critical for progress.
2. Multiline if-then-else expressions without proper parentheses frequently cause Alloy syntax errors that block verification. Enclosing entire conditional expressions in parentheses or rewriting them as single-line expressions is essential for progress.
